      "title": "Rational Functions - Formula 4",
      "latex": "\\int \\frac{1}{ax^2+bx+c}\\, dx= \\begin{cases}\n    \\frac{2}{-\\delta}\\arctan{\\frac{2ax+b}{\\sqrt{-\\delta}}}+C, \\text{ if }\\delta<0 \\\\\n     -\\frac{1}{a(x-x_1)} +C, \\text{ if }\\delta=0 \\\\\n     \\frac{1}{a(x_1-x_2)}\\ln{\\left| \\frac{x-x_1}{x-x_2} \\right|} +C, \\text{ if }\\delta>0\n\\end{cases}",
